{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>I will not</b> — I have no need to take a bull from your house. He mentioned the large [animal] that is slaughtered upon the altar." "<b>From your stalls</b> — like גזר ממכלה צאן (Proverbs 27:26); the alef and heh interchange."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {0 "Resolved הגדול as 'the large [animal]' referring to the bull; the phrase גדול הקרב read as הגדול הקרב."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:25.727144531Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}